      <h1 id="op-tkn-reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">OpenShift Pipelines tkn reference<a href="#op-tkn-reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>This section lists the basic <code>tkn</code> CLI commands.</p>
      <h2 id="_basic_syntax" class="group scroll-mt-20">Basic syntax<a href="#_basic_syntax" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p><code>tkn [command or options] [arguments...]</code></p>
      <h2 id="_global_options" class="group scroll-mt-20">Global options<a href="#_global_options" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
